-# UI Specialist Gate Final Audit: APPROVED for KANBA-72 (KB-P2-04)
-
-- Auditor: ui-specialist (UI & UX Architecture Specialist Gate)
-- Worktree: `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-72`
-- Branch: `feat/KANBA-72`
