-+# UI Specialist Gate Final Audit: APPROVED for KANBA-93 (KB-P3-46)
-+
-+- Auditor: ui-specialist (UI & UX Architecture Specialist Gate)
-+- Worktree: `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-93`
